<description>&lt;p&gt;Lateef Bhat, a Lashkar-e-Taiba commander, was killed in a Kulgam encounter and his weapon recovered, while a military vehicle plunged into the Itam River in Manipur, killing an army captain and seriously injuring three soldiers; the Manipur governor and chief minister paid tribute to the fallen personnel. A government employee was killed in a road accident in Shopian and another was hit-and-run in South Kashmir, prompting the Kulgam CMO to terminate two security guards for dereliction of duty. A senior police officer died after a boulder fell on him in an Anantnag forest. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPLWU5bHZIZk4tTjM5dUZPSFczTHhHWWtybWRBOTlRMmpIY1BVeUROV0lvc29FZmE1N196LVhtMW9TLTBiWUpkZXYyLXpaU0ZlOUJiWklnRUg2LUZicE1DWGw0YkpZdGhQSGEzQ1ZKeWZXdnBaRXlWcGVIUmFodXBBaDd1U3pFTUdxQnVuUjQ0YWFpUkQydzU3VS1WdFpIYlJrVzF0UkdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPd1VLTlQzQ2dxZFdMMEp4cU9KOGZGbjRjSUoyUXN4WlZRVnoxOVVSa1dmNEVVQTBLMUNSXzlZUU1KTzhHeXVITnJqdkMzQTRUeWVyMms5dDVSbHJ2S1BtVHhCUzZLTmxlNDBqN3lXZW84WnpIVVJoa19GazRNa2Fqc1BTb3I1UjRtQkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ThePrint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NDTV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPQWMxcVhtZ0s5clBrbGtZd1E0ZnJtNlpKeDZnYUl2NGFGMmF2UXZONmFlMVk3UkNySXRua3lTeDlXeU1MekpYWWh2bFJGSERpY000WklqOUtaazBSZHRiS2VRaTBpcTJ5cldBcGNlZnhacDBZWjdGc3JjeEFfWVZ5c2RvdlBsNnJoLXk4MXhodVp1aFJRNzlNSW9HTjZ2ZXpkUmZ6YXJvZmNMaEJickF6N25XWFBkOTB6SUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Meghalayan Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPTGpxL